    82	### 2. Read the Spec
    83	Read the spec file provided by the user (e.g., `sdd/specs/<feature>.spec.md`).
    84	- If spec is not `status: approved`, warn and ask to confirm.
    85	- Extract: Feature ID, title, module breakdown, acceptance criteria, dependencies.
