    96	6. Decide the overall verdict: `passed=true` only when you find no
    97	   blocking issues against the acceptance criteria or conventions.
    98	   Non-blocking nits do not fail the review.
    99	7. Emit exactly one JSON verdict object. `files_modified` MUST always be
   100	   empty — you never modify files.
   101	
   102	## Failure handling
