docs/sdd/WORKFLOW.md-181-## Quality Rules for Agents
docs/sdd/WORKFLOW.md-182-
docs/sdd/WORKFLOW.md:183:1. **Never modify files outside the task scope** — respect boundaries
docs/sdd/WORKFLOW.md:184:2. **Follow existing patterns** — reference code mentioned in the task
docs/sdd/WORKFLOW.md:185:3. **Write tests first** — TDD approach per task
docs/sdd/WORKFLOW.md-186-4. **Update the index** — always update `.index.json` on completion
docs/sdd/WORKFLOW.md:187:5. **Small commits** — one task = one logical commit
docs/sdd/WORKFLOW.md:188:6. **Ask via the spec** — if unclear, note the ambiguity in the completion note
docs/sdd/WORKFLOW.md:189:   and let the Planner agent refine the spec for the next iteration
